{
  "name": "@cfjjb/domain",
  "version": "0.7.0",
  "description": "Noyau m\u00e9tier CFJJB : r\u00e9f\u00e9rentiel poids/dur\u00e9es/ceintures, g\u00e9n\u00e9rateur de brackets, planning, m\u00e9dailles. TypeScript pur, sans IO.",
  "license": "UNLICENSED",
